    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Fireball of Aqshy [Огненный шар Акши].</strong> <em>Recharge 4–6.</em> As an action, the caster releases the spell at a point or target within its listed range. The target resolves the saving throw or attack profile in this item data; on a failed save, it suffers the listed damage and conditions, while a successful save halves damage when the spell allows it. The spell cannot be used again until its recharge is rolled at the start of the caster’s turn.</p><p>The magic rises like a wound in the air, shaped by will and fear. Its power returns only when the winds gather again; until then it leaves the caster listening for the next tremor of sorcery beneath the world.</p><blockquote><p>“The Old World rewards only those who turn fear into steel.”<br><em>— a scarred captain of the Empire</em></p></blockquote>",
